原始结果：[100短窗](../../.work/performance/20260907T055418Z-3f2aa8b2/stages/peak-create-r100/result.json)、[112](../../.work/performance/20260907T055418Z-3f2aa8b2/stages/refine-create-r112/result.json)、[115](../../.work/performance/20260907T055418Z-3f2aa8b2/stages/refine-create-r115/result.json)、[118](../../.work/performance/20260907T055418Z-3f2aa8b2/stages/refine-create-r118/result.json)、[125短窗](../../.work/performance/20260907T055418Z-3f2aa8b2/stages/peak-create-r125/result.json)、[100长窗](../../.work/performance/20260907T055418Z-3f2aa8b2/stages/confirm-create-r100/result.json)、[80长窗](../../.work/performance/20260907T055418Z-3f2aa8b2/stages/confirm-create-r80/result.json)、[125突发](../../.work/performance/20260907T055418Z-3f2aa8b2/stages/burst-create-r125/result.json)、[150突发](../../.work/performance/20260907T055418Z-3f2aa8b2/stages/burst-create-r150/result.json)。九档 dropped iterations 均为 0，已记录的 14 项事件故障增量均为 0；这些条件通过不抵消窗口、HTTP 或积压失败。

后台是否收敛按保存的同一采样区间计算：输入用 routeCount 增量，终态用 metadata.terminalFailed 增量（本轮为预期的 `.local` 首次拒绝终态）；未完成量为两者的存量差。采用距预热结束最近的 running 样本至最后 running 样本，约每5秒采样，故边界与 HTTP 毫秒窗口不完全重合，不能把两套计数直接逐条相减。

